@startuml figure_4_6_2_frontend_components
title 图 4.6-2 前端逻辑构件划分\n（Vue 3 工程目录与职责）

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "hospital-frontend" {
  component [布局构件\nlayout/\nPatientLayout · AdminLayout] as LAYOUT <<subsystem>>
  component [路由构件\nrouter/index.js\n权限与标题] as ROUTER <<subsystem>>
  component [页面构件\nviews/\n患者端 · 管理端 · 登录注册] as PAGES <<subsystem>>
  component [功能 / 业务组件\ncomponents/patient/*\ncomponents/admin/*\n体质·文章·对话等] as FEAT <<subsystem>>
  component [组合式逻辑\ncomposables/*.js\n可复用状态与流程] as COMP <<layer>>
  component [接口构件\napi/*.js\nAxios 调用后端] as API <<subsystem>>
  component [状态构件\nstores/*.js\nPinia] as STORE <<subsystem>>
  component [通用交互\nplugins/\nmessage、通知等] as PLUGIN <<layer>>
  component [工具构件\nutils/*.js\n格式化、校验、URL] as UTIL <<layer>>
  component [静态与样式\nassets · styles] as ASSET <<artifact>>
}

LAYOUT --> PAGES : 承载
ROUTER --> PAGES : 映射
PAGES --> FEAT : 组合
PAGES --> COMP
PAGES --> API
PAGES --> STORE
PAGES ..> PLUGIN
PAGES ..> UTIL
PAGES ..> ASSET
FEAT --> API
FEAT --> STORE
FEAT --> COMP
COMP --> API
COMP --> STORE

note bottom of API
  **说明**：与论文 4.6.2 对应——*layout* 布局、*views* 页面、*components* 功能与通用 UI、
  *api+stores* 对应 Model 侧数据获取与全局状态；**无独立「预约订单」前端路由时**，论文中该条可改为「健康计划 / 打卡」等本项目实际模块。
end note

@enduml
